WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,360
The fierce golden flower stamen is crazy

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,920
He is consuming his life essence

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,800
He wants to kill us all and run away.

4
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:12,800
There are so many pigeons, golden crabs, run away.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,400
Everyone is trash

6
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,040
shrink back when encountering difficulties

7
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,440
What's the point?

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,760
Can I still fight? No problem

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,100
Leave these little devils to you

10
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,380
I'm crushing this pyramid

11
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:39,560
There are so many pigeons, gold and crab kings to fight

12
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:44,160
Don't let them hit you

13
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:47,520
This prince is no worse than you. Oh my god.

14
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:55,890
Isn't that the enemy?

15
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,490
Then why did you join forces?
